  "text": "Skip to main content\nclose\nAdd supplemental product data\nhelp_outline\nDresslikemommy\n124884876\narrow_drop_down\nSelect how to add product data\nAdd product data from a file\n\nCreate a file that contains the data you want to add to your primary data sources. This method may require some technical knowledge.\n\npublished_with_changes\n\nAutomatically updates\n\ncheck_circle_outline\nUse Google Sheets\n\nProvide the product data you want to add to your primary sources using a Google Sheets spreadsheet.\n\npublished_with_changes\n\nAutomatically updates\n\ncheck_circle_outline\nAdd product data using API\n\nUse the Merchant API to update a large number of products or if you plan to make frequent changes to your product details. This method requires technical knowledge.\n\npublished_with_changes\n\nScheduled updates\n\ncheck_circle_outline\nEnter a link to your file\nThis only needs to be set up once. Your products on Merchant Center will automatically update with your file. How to create a file\u2060\u200e\nEnter a link to your file\n\u00a0\nEdit schedule\nAutomatically updates every 24 hours at 12:00\u202fAM \nedit\nAdd authentication information\nNo username and password provided \nedit\nAdd a file using SFTP or Google Cloud Storage\nYour file must be under 4 GB in size\nUpload a file from your computer\nYour products won't automatically update in Merchant Center\nCancel\nContinue\nReady to download Press F6 to access notification buttons.\nReady to download\nDownload\nclose",
